WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.480
- It's time I shared
something extraordinary

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.490
from social media.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:04.917
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:07.660
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.070
In 2018, while surfing in Hawaii

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:14.190
Doug lost his beloved custom
surfboard in a massive wave.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.380
Then, get this, it was
found two years later,

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.700
5,000 miles away.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.380
The board ended up in the
hands of a local school teacher

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.380
in the Philippines,

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.700
who amazingly was able to track Doug down.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.720
Now the two men have formed a bond

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.210
and are working together
for a great cause.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.730
Let's get Doug on the line, everybody.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.260
What's up Doug.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.211
- Hi, Kelly.

00:00:35.211 --> 00:00:36.350
- What's up, man.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.350
So, tell us about the surfboard

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.570
and how you managed to find it?

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.630
- So the surfboard

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:45.190
happened to be shaped by an amazing surfer

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:46.300
and it wasn't cheap.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.070
I'd saved up money to buy it.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.670
It was the most expensive
thing I owned at the time.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.010
I finally surfed on it enough

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:59.300
where I came to end up losing it.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.023
And that was devastating to me.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.180
It really bummed me out.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:08.850
Lo and behold, I'm waking up one morning

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:12.290
and I find a picture posted on Instagram

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:14.420
with my name tagged on it.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.060
And it happened to be a
picture of that surfboard.

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.440
- Wow!

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.570
I mean, first of all I gotta tell you,

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:22.260
carrying that damn thing looks hard

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.805
let alone surfing with it.

00:01:23.805 --> 00:01:26.337
I'm like, how do you carry it?

00:01:26.337 --> 00:01:28.770
And now your close friends, right?

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:29.603
- Yeah.

00:01:29.603 --> 00:01:32.193
So, Javan, the teacher who has my board,

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:37.450
we've been talking a lot
and after time went by

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:40.350
I said, "Hey, you know what?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.110
You bought this board to surf it

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:43.760
and you wanna learn how to surf."

00:01:44.809 --> 00:01:48.060
So I just thought I'd
send him surf supplies.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:51.110
Well, his first reaction
was, "Don't do that.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.850
Can you send me magazines

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.660
so my students can learn to read English?"

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:59.950
So I said, "Well, I think I
could do better than that."

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.780
Since this story is
getting so much exposure

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.890
I thought I'd do a GoFundMe.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.570
And from then until now,

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:09.434
I've raised about $7,000 for his students.

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:10.560
(audience applauding)

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.680
- Wow! Isn't that crazy?

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.750
That must be the best
purchase of your life,

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.430
that to really transform everything.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.263
- Yeah.

00:02:19.263 --> 00:02:22.640
That's the best feeling to be able to help

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.430
people who I think might be
more unfortunate than we are.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.700
- I know, but just to purchase.

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:28.820
I was talking about the surfboard.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:29.700
You've purchased that surfboard,

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.940
you put all that money
you saved, you lose it

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.830
and then it ends up being
like the best money ever spent

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.311
in such a different way.
- Yeah.

00:02:35.311 --> 00:02:39.137
So, the best $1,500 I ever lost.

00:02:39.137 --> 00:02:41.090
(laughing)

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.490
- Well, thank you so much, Doug.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:43.940
And thank you for all that you're doing.

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:45.810
It's a really beautiful thing
what you're doing right now

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.280
for his students.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:50.013
Thank you so much. I'm liking
your post right now, right?

00:02:50.013 --> 00:02:52.220
- Thank you. Thank you for having me.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.650
- Absolutely. Well, that's not all.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.910
This season we've actually
partnered with Pilot G2 Pen,

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.680
the go-to pen at the Kelly Clarkson show

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.830
and they wanna recognize great
people doing great things.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.200
So they're gonna give you $1000.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.836
- Oh, no way. That's amazing.

00:03:06.836 --> 00:03:07.669
Awesome.

00:03:07.669 --> 00:03:08.870
(laughing)

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.590
- Well, thank you so much, Doug.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.800
Have a blessed day, all right?

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.633
- Thank you.

